The test `['org.apache.commons.compress.archivers.TarTestCase.testCOMPRESS178()']` failed.
The test looks like:

```java
304 :     public void testCOMPRESS178() throws Exception {
305 :         final File input = getFile("COMPRESS-178.tar");
306 :         final InputStream is = new FileInputStream(input);
307 :         final ArchiveInputStream in = new ArchiveStreamFactory().createArchiveInputStream("tar", is);
308 :         try {
309 :             in.getNextEntry();
310 :             fail("Expected IOException");
